  "content": "<p>One of our members supports theatre projects with custom technical gadgets. This unusual-looking device recently received an update: it is a remote-controlled vehicle equipped with moving-head LED lights for creating special effects.</p><p>A particularly useful feature is its direct support for DMX, the protocol commonly used to control lighting equipment in theatre productions.</p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/theatre\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>theatre</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/stageeffects\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>stageeffects</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/dmx\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>dmx</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a></p>",
